
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ne">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Maya AI Assistant</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 24px;
      background: #101020;
      color: white;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .card {
      max-width: 420px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      padding: 24px;
      background: #20203a;
      border-radius: 20px;
    }
    h1 { color: #a78bfa; }
    input, button {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 14px;
      margin-top: 12px;
      border: 0;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 16px;
    }
    button {
      background: #8b5cf6;
      color: white;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <h1>✨ Maya AI</h1>
    <p>नमस्ते! म तपाईंको AI सहायक हुँ।</p>
    <p>छिट्टै हामी नेपालीमा AI Chat थप्नेछौँ।</p>
    <input placeholder="यहाँ आफ्नो प्रश्न लेख्नुहोस्">
    <button>🎤 बोल्नुहोस्</button>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
